In most cases, you cannot have both normal text output and "asis"
output in the same chunk.

If you have multiple tables as well as other text output, you can
collect all the character strings in a variable before you write them:
kable() returns a character vector. For example,

res = NULL
for (i in 1:10) {
  res = c(res, '\n', 'hello world', '\n', kable(iris, output = FALSE))
}
cat(res, sep = '\n')

Regards,
Yihui
